              "segment": {
                "start_index": 683,
                "end_index": 861,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Vasoconstriction (The Internal Detour):** When your immune system detects an infection, or when you are under physical stress, your sympathetic nervous system kicks into gear"
