              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2271,
                "end_index": 2509,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **The Subtracting of Red:** Healthy skin color is a visual blend of your natural skin pigments (melanin, which is brown/black, and carotene, which is yellow/orange) and the bright-red, oxygenated hemoglobin flowing in your blood vessels"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2511,
                "end_index": 2629,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "When severe nausea or illness causes vasoconstriction, **the warm red undertones are suddenly drained from your skin**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                11,
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2631,
                "end_index": 2807,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Yellow + Blue = Green:** Without the red blood to mask them, your skin\u2019s underlying cool, neutral, or yellowish pigments (carotene and melanin) become much more prominent"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2809,
                "end_index": 2868,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "At the same time, the veins right under your skin look blue"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                11
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2975,
                "end_index": 3153,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "When you overlay the blue of those veins and deoxygenated blood with the pale yellow of your bloodless skin, **yellow and blue mix to create a distinct greenish-gray complexion**"
