              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 3797,
                "end_index": 3973,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Because their bodies lacked the iron needed to create hemoglobin, their red blood cells were incredibly pale, which gave their skin a literal, unmistakable yellowish-green tint"
